    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;All promised heroes burn. Who are they now?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In war-torn world of fated heroes, flawed philosophies, and bunny-eared Demons, a burned assassin girl must find a new life purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>All the Promised Burn: An Yssaia Game</i> is a narrative-focused, hand-drawn adventure. Navigate an assassin through her delicate, brutal world after the War annexed her homeland. Delve deep into the geopolitics of magic, your past trauma, and the Abyss beneath the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Features</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coil through an epic of 10 POV characters and trip on every wound in their hearts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indulge in a full suite of fantasy disabilities, armistice logistics, &amp; tearful melt-downs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather 50+ books, recipes, creatures, and epistolaries for your lore archive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riff through 8 fully Constructed Languages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel mysteries from across the selvages of this little open world</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Additional Features</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sin-eating</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Murdered lovers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fictional Theatre Drama</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diversity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angst</p></li></ul>",
